| The C++ the Faust compiler 2.88.0 generates from those sources, embedding the Faust standard libraries | 2002-2026 GRAME | LGPL-2.1-or-later with the Faust exception (see below) |
| [Faust](https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust) compiler and architecture headers, used at build time only | 2002-2026 GRAME | LGPL-2.1-or-later with the Faust exception |
| WebCLAP port ([open-webclap](https://github.com/andremichelle/open-webclap) `ports/faust-aether`) | 2026 André Michelle | MIT |
| WASI shim ([open-webclap](https://github.com/andremichelle/open-webclap) `modules/webclap/wasi_shim.cpp`) | 2026 André Michelle | MIT |
| [CLAP](https://github.com/free-audio/clap) headers | 2014-2022 Alexandre Bique | MIT |

The Faust exception (https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/COPYING) permits linking the generated
code and the standard libraries in proprietary and in MIT-licensed works; it is the license Faust itself ships the
libraries under.

